// Title: Gpscript Execution
// ID: 1e59c230-6670-45bf-83b0-98903780607e
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-05-16
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
// Description: Detects the execution of the LOLBIN gpscript, which executes logon or startup scripts configured in Group Policy
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.command_line like "*_ /logon*" or process.command_line like "*_ /startup*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\gpscript.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "GPSCRIPT.EXE"))) and not ((process.parent.command_line == "C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe -k netsvcs -p -s gpsvc")))
